  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Refugee Forum Pledge Delivery - APNOR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASIA PACIFIC NETWORK OF REFUGES (APNOR) will deliver outputs and outcomes which will deliver the UK&apos;s pledges made at the recent Global Refugee Forum. This includes empowering refugee-led organisations and advocacy for refugee participation in governance structures. This project will also aim to promote gender equity.</narrative>
  </description>
